---
description: Operating rules for coding agents (coding-agent-kit). Always applies.
alwaysApply: true
---
Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root; it is the single source of truth.

- Workflow: clarify → design → plan → build in small verified steps → test (E2E when there is a UI) → self-review → finish.
- Never invent library APIs: check current official docs (`skills/current-docs-lookup`).
- Never claim done without running the checks and showing their output (`skills/verification-before-done`).
- Keep secrets out of source (`skills/security-and-secrets`).
- Skills live in `skills/<name>/SKILL.md`; read the relevant one when its topic comes up.
